+decision_in_scope: >
+  The product owner accepted ADR 060: a plan's branch lands on main when the plan pauses, even with issues
+  still open, and a new plan branch is cut when the plan starts again. That rule is the change's intent and is
+  not counted as a defect anywhere below.
