+      source: "docs/standards/harness-standard.md at origin/main, section 3"
+    - id: G2
+      principle: "Every part is built from its intent; the compiled part matches its ICE and carries its fingerprint (principle 4)."
+      source: "docs/standards/harness-standard.md at origin/main, section 4; CLAUDE.md at origin/main, 'Play Pipeline Rules'"
+    - id: G3
+      principle: "Build the eval first: a check exists for each promised path and it can fail for the right reason (principle 5)."
+      source: "docs/standards/harness-standard.md at origin/main, section 5"
+    - id: G4
+      principle: "A change to the harness standard is a decision: it goes through record-decision as an ADR."
+      source: "docs/standards/harness-standard.md at origin/main, 'How the standard is kept'"
+    - id: G5
+      principle: "Installed parts read, run and name only installed files; notes of origin are deleted."
