+    - id: G6
+      principle: "Shared scaffolding is one common file the plays point to, emitted by the compiler and linted."
+      source: "CLAUDE.md at origin/main, 'Durability rule for non-intent edits'; core/tools/lint-components/lib/rules/shared-scripts.js at origin/main"
+    - id: G7
+      principle: "The end plays find their issue from the branch; a start play cuts the branch."
+      source: "standards/rules/pipeline-position.md (memory copy in the grounding folder)"
+    - id: G9
