++++## Worked example
++ +
++-+### Q-A — Is "when may a plan's branch land on main?" a question for the ontology?
++++`focus` is the reference implementation (`core/components/plays/focus/`):
++ +
++-+**Question:** Must the product ontology answer when the work of a plan may go into main?
++++- The table is `reference/kind-map.yaml`; a row's `command` is the backing. A row with no
