++-+>
++-+> **Clinic — Bug "Two patients get the same slot"**, child of Story "Pick a free slot", in Epic "Self-booking".
++-+>
++-+> **Bank — Bug "Score is empty when income is zero"**, child of Story "Score the application", in Epic "One-day decision".
++++## Kinds
