+# Layer 2 design-grounding, category: memory. PR #980 (base plan/717/base), issue 719.
+# Principles come only from committed sources: the base ref (git show plan/717/base:<path>) and
+# memory read through the memory tool (copies in context/memory/grounding-memory/, with manifest.json).
+# Nothing is grounded in content this diff adds. Note: the Phoenix-memory copy of
+# standards/rules/work-plan.md lags the base ref (it still says drive / manage-plan); where the two differ
+# the base-ref text is the one cited.
